# headwear/helm/crest/crown: the forge crest accent `crown` (STYLE_P2 28.3, contracts 3c: overlay crest.<v>, anchor crown)
# PARADE: a broad gilt circlet round the dome with five points (the centre one tallest, a jewel at its foot in the
# people's colour), wider than the dome so it reads at 1x as a crown, not a cap.
# Written by the FORGE-HELM area's tools/gen.py from src/ (the hand-drawn D U R views; L is R re-lit). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
body adult
role overlay crest.crown
layer headwear
anchor crown
keys hatpose
z 2
tags overlay
legend v metal 0
legend w metal 1
legend x metal 2
legend y metal 3
legend z metal 4
