# (HELMS forge-fix i2) begin crest yield (forge fix 2): this crest steps aside on these helm outlines
# the sun crown (none): its rays are the crown
view D key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-none replace
|.

view U key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-none replace
|.

view R key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-none replace
|.

view L key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-none replace
|.

view L key lie when helmfam-crown,mass-none replace
|.

# the sun crown (mantle): its rays are the crown
view D key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-mantle replace
|.

view U key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-mantle replace
|.

view R key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-mantle replace
|.

view L key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-mantle replace
|.

view L key lie when helmfam-crown,mass-mantle replace
|.

# the sun crown (tall): its rays are the crown
