|.

view R key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-tall replace
|.

view L key rest when helmfam-crown,mass-tall replace
|.

view L key lie when helmfam-crown,mass-tall replace
|.

# (HELMS forge-fix i2) end

# (FORGE-HEAD i2) crest yield: drawn only on crown kabuto; any other alloy helm family wears no crown crest
view D key rest when alloyshape,!helmfam-crown,!helmfam-kabuto replace
|.

view U key rest when alloyshape,!helmfam-crown,!helmfam-kabuto replace
|.

